    "en": {
      "trackName": "Doodlenatics - Draw & Doodle",
      "description": "Draw Patterns: Duplicate your drawing strokes in 360 degrees to create beautiful designs.\n3D View: Turn your drawings into 3D shapes like rings, spheres, cones, and cubes. (Supported on iOS & macOS)\nCreate Detailed Designs: Add layers with different colors and sizes to your patterns.\nAutomatic Patterns: The app automatically turns your strokes into intricate designs as you draw.\nShare Your Art: Print, export high-res images, or copy your designs to share with others.\nApple Watch Support: Create and share mini‑drawings right from your wrist. Make quick strokes on your Apple Watch and watch them instantly transform into beautiful auto‑generated patterns you can send or save.\n\nWhen you purchase a subscription, payment will be charged to your Apple ID Account upon confirmation of purchase.  The subscription will renew automatically unless you cancel it at least 24 hours prior to the end of the current subscription period.  You can manage and cancel your subscriptions by going to your account settings on the App Store after purchase.  \n\nPrivacy Policy\nhttps://www.aidaluu.com/privacy/Doodlenatics.html\n\nTerms of Use\nhttps://www.aidaluu.com/tos/Doodlenatics.html",
      "releaseNotes": "Apple Watch Support — Draw mini‑patterns right on your wrist and share them instantly.\nImproved Pattern Generation — Smoother, smarter, and more detailed auto‑generated designs based on your strokes.",
